# Local notes — copy to PRIVATE.md (gitignored)

Do not commit this file with real values. `PRIVATE.md` is in `.gitignore`.

## Azure VM

- Public IP: 
- SSH user: azureuser
- SSH: `ssh azureuser@YOUR_IP`

## streak-keeper API

- URL: http://YOUR_IP:8787
- API token: (from server `streak-keeper/.env` → STREAK_API_TOKEN)

## GitHub

- Repo: owner/repo
- Deploy key public: (paste in GitHub → Settings → Deploy keys)

## Mobile .env

```
